{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21795","headline":"有鸟二十章 九 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟衆蝙蝠，长伴佳人占华屋。\n妖鼠多年羽翮生，不辨雌雄无本族。\n穿墉伺隙善潜身，昼伏宵飞恶明烛。\n大厦虽存柱石倾，暗啮栋梁成蠹木。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}